Senate because every state gets two senators,&nbsp;
you can have 50% of the population I'm sorry,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:49.120 --> 00:02:57.360
you can have 50% of the Senate votes represented&nbsp;
by those who have only 17% of the population in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:57.360 --> 00:03:02.160
their states. That's extraordinarily lopsided&nbsp;
and undemocratic, and it's considered a feature,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:02.720 --> 00:03:06.880
not a bug of the Senate by many. So we're going&nbsp;
to continue following the numbers. But support&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:06.880 --> 00:03:12.880
for abortions, legality up to record highs since&nbsp;
